WEBVTT

00:10.030 --> 00:19.870
<b>The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids</b>

00:10.030 --> 00:19.870
<b>Labyrinth Raids</b>

00:10.030 --> 00:19.870
m 124 277 l 134 267 140 274 144 272 150 275 163 260 177 271 472 271 488 261 502 275 507 270 510 274 518 267 528 277 516 288 526 298 517 306 510 299 506 304 500 299 489 312 473 302 178 302 163 313 150 300 146 303 140 299 134 306 125 297 134 287

00:10.030 --> 00:19.870
A Tank with a Rare 9,999 Resistance Skill 
Got Kicked from the Hero's Party

01:33.980 --> 01:36.900
My name is Greed.

01:37.640 --> 01:41.910
Though it seems you already know that.

01:44.000 --> 01:47.670
Greed, close up your labyrinth 
and surrender this instant.

01:48.160 --> 01:50.420
Do that, and we will spare your life.

01:50.420 --> 01:54.080
Hm? Now <i>why</i> would I do that?

01:54.080 --> 01:57.370
We've dealt with the monsters you sent our way.

01:57.870 --> 01:59.680
You've seen the power of our forces.

01:59.680 --> 02:01.420
Is that right?

02:04.000 --> 02:05.410
There are still so many.

02:08.690 --> 02:10.020
Rud, stay calm.

02:11.720 --> 02:13.730
<i>She's right. I need to calm down.</i>

02:14.120 --> 02:18.740
Sorry, but it's impossible to conquer 
Avancia with the forces you've prepared.

02:18.740 --> 02:26.760
Is it? I have practically unlimited points
 I can use to summon monsters.

02:26.760 --> 02:28.460
I believe it's only a matter of time.

02:28.770 --> 02:32.920
We'll defeat you and destroy this
 labyrinth before that happens.

02:35.070 --> 02:38.630
By the way, I've been wondering...

02:40.850 --> 02:45.030
Those two over there are 
homunculi, aren't they?

02:46.370 --> 02:47.390
What?

02:50.990 --> 02:54.090
Ms. Luna, a homunculus? What are you—

02:54.090 --> 02:54.870
Yes.

02:57.830 --> 02:59.610
So what?

03:01.950 --> 03:05.610
Oh, forgive me. I'm just a bit excited.

03:05.610 --> 03:11.700
You've grown so much more than 
I've ever seen in all of my research.

03:11.700 --> 03:16.250
Who knew living in the outside world 
would have this effect on a homunculus?

03:16.560 --> 03:20.970
Well? How do you feel 
about returning to me?

03:23.850 --> 03:26.890
My master is Mr. Rud and Mr. Rud alone!

03:30.680 --> 03:34.560
Luna, Rud. Why didn't you tell us?

03:36.020 --> 03:36.770
Sorry.

03:40.850 --> 03:42.340
I'm sorry for hiding it—

03:42.340 --> 03:43.240
Honestly.

03:44.090 --> 03:46.120
You'd better explain yourself later.

03:49.360 --> 03:49.950
Luna.

03:51.890 --> 03:52.580
Right!

03:54.080 --> 03:55.460
Good grief.

03:57.630 --> 03:59.170
Now then...

04:05.340 --> 04:08.850
Perhaps I'll simply take 
everything by force.

04:10.120 --> 04:14.060
I've never liked this form much.

04:19.020 --> 04:20.250
<i>So heavy.</i>

04:20.250 --> 04:23.740
<i>But if I strengthen 
my entire body with mana...</i>

04:32.870 --> 04:34.660
Samimina, fall back!

04:39.810 --> 04:40.800
Are you okay?

04:44.160 --> 04:48.470
Forget about me. Did you absorb 
the damage I took just now?

04:48.470 --> 04:49.190
Yeah.

04:49.190 --> 04:50.350
That isn't necessary.

04:51.290 --> 04:55.630
I live to protect the homunculi.

04:55.630 --> 04:58.560
Consider me expendable.

04:59.430 --> 05:02.520
You'd be willing to die to defeat Greed?

05:02.960 --> 05:03.530
Yes.

05:05.240 --> 05:06.650
In that case...

05:07.360 --> 05:09.330
stay out of this fight.

05:10.680 --> 05:12.540
I don't want anyone to die.

05:13.070 --> 05:16.250
I'm a homunculus. My life is worthless.

05:16.900 --> 05:19.800
Greed used your kind like tools.

05:20.900 --> 05:24.920
Do you really want me to become 
the kind of human you hate?

05:25.890 --> 05:31.010
If you don't, then don't throw 
your life away fighting. Got it?

05:34.050 --> 05:35.100
What's this?

05:35.760 --> 05:38.810
Is this really the time for chitchat?

05:39.140 --> 05:40.400
Magic Shield.

05:43.000 --> 05:44.740
Impudent girls.

05:45.120 --> 05:46.240
Provoke!

05:47.830 --> 05:51.590
A skill? How aggravating.

05:59.800 --> 06:01.470
I've nullified his magic.

06:01.940 --> 06:02.750
How dare you.

06:10.180 --> 06:12.520
You'll pay for that!

06:13.250 --> 06:15.630
L-Let go of me! Let go!

06:16.690 --> 06:20.230
I feel so weak. Wait, these shackles...

06:20.540 --> 06:23.230
Damn. Damn!

06:33.990 --> 06:36.580
Life Burst!

06:38.740 --> 06:39.920
The Hero?

06:39.920 --> 06:40.830
Stay sharp!

06:40.830 --> 06:41.960
R-Right.

06:43.360 --> 06:46.550
You guys are doing well.

06:47.120 --> 06:48.810
So act like it.

06:50.720 --> 06:51.930
Got it.

06:58.270 --> 06:59.480
Incredible.

06:59.990 --> 07:02.240
Ms. Amon, help us fight.

07:02.240 --> 07:04.730
What? But I'm tired.

07:05.140 --> 07:07.300
I wish you'd all be quiet.

07:08.080 --> 07:14.740
Ms. Manicia said she was going to make 
sweet donuts to reward you for your efforts.

07:15.330 --> 07:19.120
Maybe I should tell her she needn't bother
 for someone who refuses to fight.

07:19.120 --> 07:22.680
Wh-What? Wh-Why didn't you say so sooner?

07:23.270 --> 07:25.450
I must join the fight.

07:27.520 --> 07:32.310
Pitiful beasts, return to darkness.

07:33.040 --> 07:36.140
Chat Magic Valnoir!

07:42.370 --> 07:43.620
Run!

07:54.480 --> 07:58.160
Whoa now. Try not to 
destroy the town with them.

07:58.890 --> 08:01.620
Okay, let's bring Greed back to town.

08:04.160 --> 08:05.100
What's this?

08:05.650 --> 08:08.590
Do demon kings have 
this kind of gem on their chests?

08:08.920 --> 08:11.020
No, wait. Could it be?

08:19.460 --> 08:20.320
<i>What </i>is<i> this?</i>

08:27.770 --> 08:32.070
<i>What we've faced so far 
doesn't compare to this.</i>

08:42.430 --> 08:44.010
Are you the real Greed?

08:45.830 --> 08:50.590
Since it was copied from 
my memories and abilities,

08:50.590 --> 08:54.420
that homunculus could be 
considered "real" as well.

08:55.100 --> 08:58.500
Its abilities seem slightly inferior, though.

09:00.060 --> 09:02.730
My name is Greed.

09:02.730 --> 09:04.010
Nice to meet you.

09:04.470 --> 09:07.350
Though I suppose 
greetings are unnecessary.

09:08.880 --> 09:12.150
After all, we'll be parting soon.

09:13.240 --> 09:15.030
<i>His attacks are fast.</i>

09:15.820 --> 09:16.850
Rud!

09:17.470 --> 09:18.450
I'm okay.

09:19.450 --> 09:23.410
<i>Even the tiniest movement
 packs a real punch.</i>

09:24.020 --> 09:26.670
<i>I can't defeat him without 
enhancing myself with more mana.</i>

09:35.170 --> 09:36.010
Rud!

09:42.400 --> 09:44.600
He's tougher than Amon.

09:44.600 --> 09:46.730
Skill: Fusion.

09:52.940 --> 09:54.900
Don't worry. Keep it up.

10:04.590 --> 10:05.600
En garde!

10:07.540 --> 10:08.840
Ms. Samimina!

10:10.360 --> 10:11.810
Thank you.

10:17.080 --> 10:19.680
Get back in formation.

10:22.310 --> 10:23.390
What's this?

10:30.770 --> 10:32.230
Master!

10:35.020 --> 10:37.340
That took a chunk 
out of my absorb shield.

10:38.080 --> 10:39.720
I'll draw his attention.

10:39.720 --> 10:41.440
Heal Rud in the meantime.

10:41.440 --> 10:42.160
Got it.

10:46.130 --> 10:50.240
<i>Even as Lilialy, 
Greed has them on the defensive.</i>

10:51.260 --> 10:57.050
<i>Our best shot at winning is to wait for 
a chance to land a single powerful blow.</i>

10:58.540 --> 10:59.780
Provoke!

11:07.780 --> 11:08.560
Pointless.

11:21.030 --> 11:23.290
<i>I've taken 20,000 damage so far.</i>

11:23.850 --> 11:25.780
<i>This will end the battle.</i>

11:26.240 --> 11:28.620
Life Conversion!

11:32.560 --> 11:35.600
Luna, Samimina, carry those two to Nin.

11:35.600 --> 11:36.250
Right!

11:40.850 --> 11:41.770
No way.

11:42.890 --> 11:45.890
<i>Lilia and Lily are out of the fight.</i>

11:46.210 --> 11:47.190
<i>What should we do?</i>

11:53.500 --> 11:57.360
<i>I'm not strong or fast enough to beat him
 with my current mana enhancement.</i>

11:58.450 --> 12:02.070
<i>I need to focus more 
of my mana on my body.</i>

12:11.710 --> 12:15.420
<i>Damn. I lost a huge chunk 
of my absorb shield.</i>

12:16.250 --> 12:19.880
<i>But now, I can use Life Conversion again.</i>

12:20.380 --> 12:25.590
<i>I'll imbue my entire body with mana 
and hit him with everything I've got.</i>

12:25.590 --> 12:28.050
Life Conversion!

12:33.480 --> 12:34.520
Rud!

12:37.100 --> 12:40.110
<i>Did he break my absorb shield?</i>

12:41.280 --> 12:46.020
<i>Even when I focus my mana on myself, 
I'm in too much pain to move.</i>

12:47.910 --> 12:50.340
Run, guys!

12:53.710 --> 12:54.910
<i>What's going on?</i>

12:54.910 --> 12:57.920
Ms. Luna! Ms. Nin! Get behind me! Run!

12:56.060 --> 13:00.510
<i>Did Greed's attack knock me back?</i>

13:02.300 --> 13:03.600
Samimina!

13:03.600 --> 13:04.760
<i>Hurry.</i>

13:05.240 --> 13:07.950
<i>I must save the others.</i>

13:08.800 --> 13:12.590
<i>D-Damn. My mana won't...</i>

13:13.230 --> 13:14.620
<i>Hurry!</i>

13:17.360 --> 13:22.540
<i>All their shields are gone.</i>

13:33.990 --> 13:34.810
<i>Luna!</i>

13:35.970 --> 13:40.210
<i>At this rate, Luna and the others...</i>

13:40.770 --> 13:42.180
<i>Move.</i>

13:43.420 --> 13:44.480
<i>Please.</i>

13:45.730 --> 13:46.880
<i>Damn it!</i>

13:47.480 --> 13:51.070
<i>Pour all of your mana into your body.</i>

13:51.070 --> 13:53.840
<i>Ignore the pain 
coursing through your body.</i>

13:54.350 --> 13:56.220
<i>Exceed your limits.</i>

13:56.220 --> 13:57.310
<i>I am...</i>

13:58.080 --> 14:00.810
<i>this party's tank!</i>

14:16.720 --> 14:18.020
Rud?

14:27.010 --> 14:28.480
Rud?

14:35.900 --> 14:41.690
<i>Destroy it. Destroy it. Destroy it.</i>

14:37.110 --> 14:39.220
<i>I hear a voice echoing around my head.</i>

14:41.960 --> 14:45.630
<i>It's telling me to destroy everything.</i>

14:45.630 --> 14:47.150
<i>Destroy it!</i>

15:01.000 --> 15:06.830
<i>I'll keep pouring my mana into my body 
and pummel him until I destroy him.</i>

15:07.250 --> 15:12.630
<i>Again. And again. And again!</i>

15:15.330 --> 15:19.060
<i>This is so much fun.</i>

15:19.300 --> 15:20.020
Rud!

15:23.580 --> 15:24.480
<i>Who was that?</i>

15:26.380 --> 15:28.010
<i>I can't see clearly.</i>

15:28.950 --> 15:30.860
<i>Is there something else there?</i>

15:32.560 --> 15:35.950
<i>Then, I must destroy it.</i>

15:41.640 --> 15:43.840
Come to your senses.

15:45.340 --> 15:46.300
Nin?

15:46.300 --> 15:48.750
I hit you with a bit of magic.

15:48.750 --> 15:50.260
How do you feel? Back to normal?

15:50.260 --> 15:52.140
Uh, yeah.

15:53.830 --> 15:56.490
<i>I felt like I'd been 
swallowed up by my own mana.</i>

15:57.430 --> 16:00.100
<i>That must've made me lose my senses.</i>

16:04.250 --> 16:05.170
Rud!

16:05.630 --> 16:07.770
My mana's acting on its own.

16:10.660 --> 16:12.240
<i>Destroy it.</i>

16:12.240 --> 16:13.860
You must control it.

16:14.130 --> 16:18.120
Those who fail to control 
their mana become monsters.

16:18.430 --> 16:22.960
<i>I've heard this voice before.</i>

16:23.790 --> 16:24.810
<i>It was...</i>

16:27.590 --> 16:29.470
<i>my voice all along.</i>

16:31.820 --> 16:35.880
<i>At this rate, I might transform 
into a monster and lose control.</i>

16:36.760 --> 16:37.920
Rud.

16:37.920 --> 16:41.680
<i>Deep breaths. Repress your mana.</i>

16:44.000 --> 16:45.120
Rud!

16:48.550 --> 16:49.570
Rud.

16:50.010 --> 16:51.920
Thanks, Nin.

16:52.400 --> 16:56.160
Because of you, 
I was able to repress my mana.

16:58.250 --> 16:59.620
I'm glad.

17:02.960 --> 17:05.860
<i>I can't afford to be swallowed up
 by my mana right now.</i>

17:06.660 --> 17:09.750
<i>I have to protect the others.</i>

17:14.240 --> 17:15.240
Greed.

17:17.930 --> 17:21.460
The place you're defending
 will soon be destroyed.

17:22.510 --> 17:32.530
I will wipe every last speck of it from
 the face of this world, as I will you.

17:34.240 --> 17:36.060
Nin, I need you to do something.

17:36.820 --> 17:40.200
Keep casting healing magic on me.

17:40.200 --> 17:41.260
What?

17:41.260 --> 17:43.190
Don't stop for even a second.

17:43.920 --> 17:47.420
I'm going to put everything 
into this attack.

17:48.150 --> 17:50.780
I know it's an unreasonable request, but...

17:50.780 --> 17:52.380
What are you talking about?

17:52.800 --> 17:55.420
I'm your party's healer.

17:56.030 --> 17:57.510
Do what you have to do.

17:58.200 --> 17:59.010
Right.

17:59.470 --> 18:02.000
<i>Keep fighting. Don't give up.</i>

18:02.000 --> 18:04.510
<i>Life Burst!</i>

18:04.510 --> 18:08.270
<i>You'd need a century's more
experience to challenge me.</i>

18:08.270 --> 18:12.020
<i>I've almost finished another sword. 
Take it to the battlefield quickly.</i>

18:12.020 --> 18:15.830
<i>Make them your priority. 
We need more bandages.</i>

18:19.510 --> 18:20.660
Greed.

18:21.110 --> 18:22.580
Thank you.

18:22.580 --> 18:23.590
What?

18:23.590 --> 18:29.600
The adventurers, the guards, 
the homunculi, Marius, and Amon...

18:29.600 --> 18:33.420
My skill has detected that 
they're all in the same place.

18:36.450 --> 18:38.840
Shield of Sacrifice!

18:40.350 --> 18:42.220
My body suddenly feels lighter.

18:42.220 --> 18:43.560
What is this?

18:43.870 --> 18:46.020
My absorb shield stopped taking damage.

18:46.020 --> 18:47.970
Is this...

18:47.970 --> 18:50.020
Rud's skill?

18:50.970 --> 18:51.860
Greed.

18:52.870 --> 18:56.150
Because you showed me Avancia,

18:56.510 --> 19:01.530
I can take on the absorb shields
 of everyone there.

19:05.820 --> 19:08.090
I, the world's strongest tank...

19:12.860 --> 19:16.960
will protect <i>all</i> of it!

19:19.420 --> 19:23.260
Life Conversion!

19:44.110 --> 19:45.650
Brother?

19:46.490 --> 19:47.720
Is it Rud?

19:47.720 --> 19:48.950
He's back?

19:49.670 --> 19:50.930
It's Rud!

19:51.290 --> 19:51.920
Rud!

19:51.920 --> 19:53.880
Brother.

19:55.280 --> 19:57.840
Manicia. You guys.

19:58.400 --> 19:59.800
Brother.

20:04.250 --> 20:08.720
I knew you'd return.

20:09.690 --> 20:13.230
I always do.

20:14.810 --> 20:16.220
You're right.

20:17.070 --> 20:19.250
Welcome back, dear brother.

20:19.850 --> 20:21.770
I'm home, Manicia.

20:22.390 --> 20:23.660
Rud.

20:24.190 --> 20:25.660
Marius. Amon.

20:26.080 --> 20:27.240
You're all right.

20:27.240 --> 20:32.580
With so many to deal with, 
we couldn't lead as well as you.

20:32.580 --> 20:35.120
But we managed to defend the town.

20:35.120 --> 20:37.460
Thanks, you two.

20:37.460 --> 20:39.340
Rud!

20:40.700 --> 20:44.190
You really conquered 
that labyrinth in record time!

20:44.190 --> 20:45.760
Amazing!

20:45.760 --> 20:46.800
Guys.

20:47.980 --> 20:50.500
Because you were all protecting the town,

20:51.040 --> 20:53.810
we successfully destroyed the labyrinth.

20:54.600 --> 20:55.540
Thank you.

20:58.920 --> 20:59.840
Mr. Rud.

21:05.090 --> 21:07.280
Rud truly is...

21:07.980 --> 21:10.990
...the strongest tank!

23:05.790 --> 23:08.120
<i>I, Rud, am a tank.</i>

23:08.690 --> 23:12.240
<i>I was my party's shield.</i>

23:12.240 --> 23:14.950
<i>This is the story of how I turned it around,
 became the protagonist,</i>

23:15.990 --> 23:20.620
<i>and will continue fighting 
to protect everything.</i>
